<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>인천인테리어 - 프리미엄 공간 디자인</title>
    <!-- 나눔고딕 폰트 불러오기 -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Gothic:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        /* ==================== ROOT VARIABLES & BASE STYLE ==================== */
        :root {
            --dark-blue: #0f172a;
            --navy-blue: #1e3a8a;
            --royal-blue: #2563eb;
            --light-blue: #eff6ff;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text-dark: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --text-light: #f8fafc;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Nanum Gothic', sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        /* ==================== HEADER & BOOKMARK NAVIGATION ==================== */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--royal-blue);
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .nav-menu a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-menu a:hover {
            color: var(--royal-blue);
        }

        /* ==================== HERO SECTION (DARK BLUE) ==================== */
        #hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-blue) 0%, var(--navy-blue) 100%);
            color: var(--white);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 6rem 2rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--royal-blue);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--royal-blue);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
        }

        /* ==================== COMMON SECTION STYLE ==================== */
        section {
            padding: 6rem 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* ==================== ABOUT SECTION (WHITE) ==================== */
        #about {
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: var(--light-blue);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
        }

        .stat-card h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--royal-blue);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-card p {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        /* ==================== SERVICES SECTION (LIGHT BLUE) ==================== */
        #services {
            background-color: var(--light-blue);
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .service-card {
            background-color: var(--white);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--navy-blue);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* ==================== PORTFOLIO SECTION (DARK NAVY) ==================== */
        #portfolio {
            background-color: var(--dark-blue);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        #portfolio .section-header p {
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .portfolio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .portfolio-item {
            background: var(--navy-blue);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .portfolio-img {
            height: 240px;
            background-color: #334155;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .portfolio-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .portfolio-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .portfolio-info p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* ==================== CONTACT SECTION (ROYAL BLUE/WHITE) ==================== */
        #contact {
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

        .contact-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
            background: var(--navy-blue);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .contact-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .contact-info p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .contact-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .contact-form input,
        .contact-form textarea {
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .contact-form button {
            background-color: var(--royal-blue);
            color: var(--white);
            border: none;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .contact-form button:hover {
            background-color: #1d4ed8;
        }

        /* ==================== FOOTER ==================== */
        footer {
            background-color: #020617;
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
        }

        /* ==================== ANIMATION CLASS ==================== */
        .fade-in {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
        }

        .fade-in.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* Responsive UI */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-menu { display: none; }
            .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .contact-wrapper { padding: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAV (BOOKMARK) -->
    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#hero" class="logo">인천<span>인테리어</span></a>
            <nav>
                <ul class="nav-menu">
                    <li><a href="#about">회사소개</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#services">서비스</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#portfolio">포트폴리오</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">상담문의</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section id="hero">
        <div class="hero-content fade-in">
            <span class="hero-badge">대한민국 대표 인테리어 솔루션</span>
            <h1>공간의 가치를 바꾸는<br>인천인테리어의 독보적 기술력</h1>
            <p>상업 공간부터 주거 공간까지, 전국 최대 규모의 맞춤형 설계 및 시공 서비스를 경험해보세요.</p>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">무료 견적 상담 신청하기</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
    <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header fade-in">
                <h2>대한민국 최대 규모 서비스</h2>
                <p>숫자로 증명하는 인천인테리어의 신뢰와 전문성입니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-card fade-in">
                    <h3>15,000+</h3>
                    <p>누적 시공 프로젝트</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card fade-in">
                    <h3>99.2%</h3>
                    <p>고객 만족도</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card fade-in">
                    <h3>A+</h3>
                    <p>신용평가 등급</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SERVICES SECTION -->
    <section id="services">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header fade-in">
                <h2>전문 솔루션</h2>
                <p>고객의 요구에 맞춘 정교한 원스톱 시스템을 제공합니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <div class="service-card fade-in">
                    <h3>주거 공간 리모델링</h3>
                    <p>아파트, 빌라, 단독주택 등 삶의 질을 높이는 맞춤형 리빙 인테리어를 제안합니다.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card fade-in">
                    <h3>상업 공간 인테리어</h3>
                    <p>카페, 사무실, 병원 등 브랜드 가치를 최적화하는 최적의 동선과 디자인을 연출합니다.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card fade-in">
                    <h3>3D 가상 시뮬레이션</h3>
                    <p>시공 전 3D 입체 설계를 통해 완성된 공간을 미리 확인하고 수정할 수 있습니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PORTFOLIO SECTION -->
    <section id="portfolio">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header fade-in">
                <h2>시공 포트폴리오</h2>
                <p>인천인테리어가 완성한 트렌디한 시공 사례입니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="portfolio-grid">
                <div class="portfolio-item fade-in">
                    <div class="portfolio-img">PROJECT IMAGE 01</div>
                    <div class="portfolio-info">
                        <h3>송도 미니멀 아파트 45평</h3>
                        <p>모던하고 정갈한 분위기의 미니멀 라이프 스타일 구현</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="portfolio-item fade-in">
                    <div class="portfolio-img">PROJECT IMAGE 02</div>
                    <div class="portfolio-info">
                        <h3>청라 플래그십 카페 80평</h3>
                        <p>다크블루와 로열블루 톤을 적극 활용한 프리미엄 상업공간</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="portfolio-item fade-in">
                    <div class="portfolio-img">PROJECT IMAGE 03</div>
                    <div class="portfolio-info">
                        <h3>구월 스마트 오피스 120평</h3>
                        <p>업무 효율성과 개방감을 극대화한 현대적 테크 오피스</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACT SECTION -->
    <section id="contact">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="contact-wrapper fade-in">
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <h3>지금 바로 상담받으세요</h3>
                    <p>전문 디자이너가 1:1로 밀착 상담을 도와드립니다. 고민하지 말고 문의를 남겨주세요.</p>
                    <p><strong>대표전화:</strong> 1588-0000</p>
                    <p><strong>이메일:</strong> info@incheon-interior.com</p>
                </div>
                <form class="contact-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('상담 신청이 완료되었습니다.');">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="성함" required>
                    <input type="tel" placeholder="연락처" required>
                    <textarea rows="4" placeholder="문의 내용 (공간 유형, 평수 등)" required></textarea>
                    <button type="submit">무료 상담 신청</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 인천인테리어. All rights reserved. 대한민국 최대 인테리어 서비스</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- INTERACTION SCRIPT -->
    <script>
        // 스크롤 시 요소 나타남(Fade-in) 애니메이션 JS
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const observerOptions = {
                root: null,
                rootMargin: '0px',
                threshold: 0.15
            };

            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {
                entries.forEach(entry => {
                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
                    }
                });
            }, observerOptions);

            const fadeElements = document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in');
            fadeElements.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
